    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index increased 533 points week-on-week to 7,173 points. The downward trend of fronthaul and round-voyage rates for the past 5 weeks has now been broken. Fronthaul earnings were up $5,000/day to $29,350/day, while the round-voyage rates as assessed by SSY were up $3,250/day to $9,250/day.",
